arge.png?m=1775805794", "created": 1517081618, "last_modified": 1775805794, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "cskeleton", "last_touched": 1786076488, "title": "尝了尝动态血糖仪的咸淡，我觉得很 OK", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232632", "created": 1786068922, "deleted": 0, "content": "从京东薅的七天全返的动态血糖仪\r\n戴了两天\r\n目前感觉良好\r\n平均血糖 5.0\r\n\r\n昨日早餐：\r\n桂格即食燕麦片+牛奶 200ml+一个全蛋+一块全麦煎饼+一小碟猪肉丝\r\n餐后 1 小时血糖飚到 7.7\r\n https://i.imgur.com/G0jquVo.png \r\n \r\n 昨日午餐：\r\n 印尼虾仔谷物饭+炙烤鸡腿肉（去皮）+蔬菜\r\nhttps://i.imgur.com/aZhX8ib.jpeg \r\n餐后 1.5 小时血糖达到峰值 6.7\r\n  https://i.imgur.com/ZdkYSNX.png \r\n\r\n昨日晚餐：\r\n一整个红心火龙果+一小盒煎烤鸡胸肉\r\nhttps://i.imgur.com/kNP43ec.jpeg \r\n餐后 1 小时血糖达到峰值 6.3\r\n https://i.imgur.com/LRje92w.png \r\n \r\n 今日早餐：\r\n 500 毫升牛奶+桂格即食燕麦片+两个全蛋\r\n 餐后 1 小时血糖到达峰值 7.1\r\n  https://i.imgur.com/IlE0rAV.png \r\n  蛋白质增加+碳水减少的情况下，血糖峰值降低了 0.7\r\n  \r\n  总体来说这个数值变化对于饮食控制还是很有参考价值的\r\n  今天是立秋，特意跟我老公发了微信让他别给我点奶茶(￣▽￣\") \r\n  也算是被无形监督下的一点收获了，哈哈哈\r\n  https://i.imgur.com/uRQC5dh.png \r\n  如果没有太大的过敏反应（对一切胶布都过敏，发痒起水泡基本是时间问题），我后续应该会长期佩戴动态血糖仪来配合饮食管理", "content_rendered": "从京东薅的七天全返的动态血糖仪<br />戴了两天<br />目前感觉良好<br />平均血糖 5.0<br /><br />昨日早餐：<br />桂格即食燕麦片+牛奶 200ml+一个全蛋+一块全麦煎饼+一小碟猪肉丝<br />餐后 1 小时血糖飚到 7.7<br /> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/G0jquVo.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G0jquVo.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br /> <br /> 昨日午餐：<br /> 印尼虾仔谷物饭+炙烤鸡腿肉（去皮）+蔬菜<br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/aZhX8ib.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aZhX8ib.jpeg\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br />餐后 1.5 小时血糖达到峰值 6.7<br />  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZdkYSNX.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZdkYSNX.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br /><br />昨日晚餐：<br />一整个红心火龙果+一小盒煎烤鸡胸肉<br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/kNP43ec.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kNP43ec.jpeg\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br />餐后 1 小时血糖达到峰值 6.3<br /> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/LRje92w.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LRje92w.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br /> <br /> 今日早餐：<br /> 500 毫升牛奶+桂格即食燕麦片+两个全蛋<br /> 餐后 1 小时血糖到达峰值 7.1<br />  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/IlE0rAV.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IlE0rAV.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br />  蛋白质增加+碳水减少的情况下，血糖峰值降低了 0.7<br />  <br />  总体来说这个数值变化对于饮食控制还是很有参考价值的<br />  今天是立秋，特意跟我老公发了微信让他别给我点奶茶(￣▽￣\") <br />  也算是被无形监督下的一点收获了，哈哈哈<br />  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/uRQC5dh.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uRQC5dh.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br />  如果没有太大的过敏反应（对一切胶布都过敏，发痒起水泡基本是时间问题），我后续应该会长期佩戴动态血糖仪来配合饮食管理", "last_modified": 1786068922, "replies": 61, "id": 1232632}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11416, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2428, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 87357, "username": "ngu", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/ngu", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e5a56ab042db503ed97578046eae3e43?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e5a56ab042db503ed97578046eae3e43?s=48&d=re